      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\">Cebel-i<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><em>\u02bfAmm\u0101re</em>: It is a mountain in the land of\u00a0<em>\u02bfUdva</em>. It overlooks the sea, and only God knows the number of the nations upon it. When the Strait Sea (Ba\u1e25r-i Zu\u1e33\u0101\u1e33, i.e., the Strait of Gibraltar) extends toward Ceuta (<em>Sebte</em>), it becomes contiguous with a city called\u00a0<em>B\u0101r\u012bs</em>, and the distance between the two is one hundred miles. And opposite\u00a0<em>B\u0101r\u012bs</em>, on the Andalusian side, lies M\u00e1laga (<em>Mala\u0121a</em>). [translation]</p>",
